OL,3,GNEWSATwo taken to hospital after crash
OL,4,Aon A9 in Perthshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been taken to hospital
OL,7,Ffollowing a two-vehicle collision on
OL,8,Fthe A9, south of Perth.
OL,10,FThe incident happened shortly before
OL,11,F08:00 near Tibbermore.
OL,13,FThe road was closed northbound for more
OL,14,Fthan three hours as a result of the
OL,15,Fcollision.
OL,17,FThe Scottish Ambulance Service (SAS)
OL,18,Fsaid it sent an ambulance and paramedic
OL,19,Fresponse unit to the scene.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
